            "Pass read-only graphs, matrices, edge lists and vectors by const reference; retain mutable path histories and matrix snapshots.",
            "Replace membership early exits with an integer OR reduction suitable for SIMD.",
            "Replace packed MST flags with contiguous bytes and separate minimum-key and minimum-index reductions, preserving first-index ties and the INT_MAX unreachable sentinel."
          ]
        },
